    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Chinese "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "artist",
            "ref": "v-artist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Cai Gao has won the 2026 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Hans Christian Andersen Award for Illustration",
            "zh": "国际安徒生奖插画家奖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "is famous for",
            "ref": "v-famous-for"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " her drawings and children’s books. But her ideas don’t just come from a desk. They often come from a garden."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cai has a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rooftop garden",
            "zh": "屋顶花园"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at her home in Hunan. She has grown many plants there, such as flowers, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "herbs",
            "zh": "药草"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and green plants. Every morning, she goes to the roof to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "take care of",
            "ref": "v-take-care-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " her plants. She walks among them and enjoys the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sunrise",
            "ref": "v-sunrise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "treats",
            "zh": "对待"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them like her friends and does not want to leave them for long."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cai also cares about the trees near her home. She believes they have their own stories if people "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pay attention",
            "zh": "留心"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For Cai, her “garden” is not only plants, but also daily life. When she was a child, she saw rain, streets, flowers and people in her "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "neighbourhood",
            "zh": "邻里"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These small things made her happy and gave her ideas. She "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "remembers",
            "ref": "v-remember"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " sounds like rain on "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "umbrellas",
            "ref": "v-umbrella"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and people selling flowers in the street."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now she turns these "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "memories",
            "zh": "记忆"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into drawings and stories for children. She has "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "created",
            "ref": "v-create"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more than 40 books. Cai says she loves nature, life and her home country."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
